al estate investment trust (\u201cREIT\u201d) focused on acquiring, owning, and managing properties with frontage that are leased to a diversified tenant base. Our real estate-first investment strategy is centered around highly visible properties in prominent retail corridors with strong underlying real estate fundamentals. We target properties along high-traffic roads that offer strong consumer visibility and adaptable building formats capable of supporting various businesses over time. As of June 30, 2026, FrontView owned a diversified portfolio of 316 direct frontage properties across 35 U.S.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1988494/000119312526336727/fvr-ex99_1.htm","filed":"2026-08-06","source":"8-K"},"da_v":2}